  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SPIRI Dialogue With Iran Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The projects aim to continue and strengthen the practically oriented dialogue launched in 2009 on Iran&apos;s potential role in regional cooperation in respect to Afghanistan. The project facilitates the work of a group of leading regional and international experts to develop practical proposals for regional cooperation that can accompany and support the transition to a new security situation in Afghanistan ahead of and beyond the planned ISAF drawdown up to 2014. The project will also provide a valuable channel through which influential specialists from the United States with close links to the US administration can establish and develop informal contacts on key issues with Iranian figures.</narrative>
  </description>
